OL,3,GNEWSA'I was at the pub - then my wife's
OL,4,Abag exploded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is warning about the dangers of
OL,7,F"knock off" batteries after his wife's
OL,8,Fvape blew up "like a firework".
OL,10,FDusty Sheppard said he was outside a
OL,11,Fpub in Gomshall in Surrey on Friday
OL,12,Fwhen "all of a sudden flames flew out"
OL,13,Fof his wife's Maz's handbag.
OL,15,F"It [was] like someone holding a Roman
OL,16,Fcandle," he told the BBC.
OL,18,F"She felt the heat against her leg,
OL,19,Fthrew her bag off and ran away like
OL,20,Feverybody else. [Her] reactions were
OL,21,Fvery good."
